WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.890 --> 00:00:13.250
26. Hikikomori. There may be more than a million of them, but you'd never know it. They're hidden away,

2
00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:22.850
locked inside houses or rooms. They're Hikikomori, the invisible people of Japan. Hikikomori, in

3
00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:30.490
Japanese with drawing or being confined, are people, mostly men, who go to great lengths to

4
00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:37.410
pull out of society. In the West, this would be called extreme social phobia or agoraphobia,

5
00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:45.050
fear of being outside. But the Hikikomori situation is more widespread in Japan. It is also mostly

6
00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:51.890
ignored, out of shame. One boy walked into his family's kitchen when he was 14, shut the door,

7
00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:59.570
and refused to come out. The family eventually built another kitchen to use. Takeshi, 19,

8
00:00:59.570 --> 00:01:06.850
spent four years in his bedroom, listening to music and playing video games. YS actually

9
00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:13.690
stayed in his room for over 13 years. He was tired of being bullied at school and couldn't

10
00:01:13.690 --> 00:01:21.010
take being out in the world anymore. Bullying, breakups, or tests are often triggers that cause

11
00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:28.130
these young men to snap and become Hikikomori. Dr. Henry Grubb, who has studied Hikikomori,

12
00:01:28.210 --> 00:01:35.370
says the Japanese way of avoiding confrontation makes it worse. In the West, Hikikomori would be

13
00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:41.890
treated as being mentally ill, whereas in Japan, they're seen as a family problem. It's also common

14
00:01:41.890 --> 00:01:47.850
for Japanese mothers to serve their sons. Instead of making their boys do something difficult, like

15
00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:55.210
go outside, Japanese mothers may simply attend to their boys' needs. Then, when schools don't

16
00:01:55.290 --> 00:02:01.730
pursue children who don't attend, it becomes very easy for a society to pretend the Hikikomori

17
00:02:01.730 --> 00:02:09.090
don't exist. But Hikikomori cannot be served for the rest of their lives by aging parents. Groups

18
00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:15.050
like Newstart are trying to get these boys out and teach them how to fend for themselves before

19
00:02:15.050 --> 00:02:15.930
it's too late.
